{%- comment -%}
  The espresso strip above the header — port of components/layout/announcement-bar.tsx.

  One line, uppercase at label tracking, and nothing interactive in it: a bar
  that carries a link competes with the nav directly underneath it. Empty copy
  renders nothing at all rather than an empty band, which is why this is an
  `if` and not a Copy placeholder — an announcement nobody wrote is an
  announcement that should not be on the page.

  BROWNED 2026-09-22, on instruction ("warnanya masih hitam, ganti ke coklat"
  about this bar's default "Free shipping on orders..." message). `bg-brand`
  / `text-on-brand` (Camel, see `design/color-palette.jpg`) replace `bg-invert`
  / `text-ink-invert` on this one strip — the same reasoning `two-ways.liquid`'s
  `brand` tone documents: `--color-invert` is the footer's and voices wall's
  background too, so retinting it would have browned both of those as a side
  effect of a change asked for on this bar alone.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- if settings.announcement != blank -%}
  <div class="bg-brand text-on-brand">
    <p class="mx-auto max-w-content px-gutter py-2.5 text-center text-micro uppercase tracking-label">
      {{ settings.announcement }}
    </p>
  </div>
{%- endif -%}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Announcement bar",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "The message is set once for the whole site under Theme settings → Announcement bar."
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
